          <p>We are in the early-growth phase: onboarding transporters and cargo owners corridor by corridor, building density in the highest-value lanes first (Lusaka–Johannesburg, Lusaka–Dar, Harare–Durban), then expanding outward. Our go-to-market strategy leverages industry associations, freight agent networks, and direct enterprise outreach to mining and FMCG companies.</p>
